Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:07.62,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a way to win the title!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这样拿下冠军 太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:11.17,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡洛斯 阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:14.72,TL,,0,0,240,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Vienna champion for the first time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一次成为维也纳冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:16.51,TL,,0,0,0,,截至维也纳夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.51,0:00:19.99,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡今年在{\fs78}500{\fs68}级赛事{\fs78}16{\fs68}胜{\fs78}0{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:22.59,TL,,0,0,0,,跨赛季 则是{\fs78}26{\fs68}连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:24.60,TL,,0,0,0,,上一次在这个级别输球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:27.31,TL,,0,0,0,,还是去年巴塞罗那决赛对鲁内
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:31.02,TL,,0,0,0,,先从几座奖杯 看这条连胜的来路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:33.71,TL,,0,0,0,,去年 女王杯和东京
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:36.02,TL,,0,0,0,,他连续两站五战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:38.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}场胜利 两座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:40.42,TL,,0,0,0,,换了城市 换了场地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.94,TL,,0,0,0,,这条连胜还没有停下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:49.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Your 2025 champion, Carlos Alcaraz!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年冠军 阿尔卡拉斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:55.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But it is Carlos celebrating in the Colosseum at Ariake.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N此刻 在有明庆祝的是卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:57.99,TL,,0,0,0,,来到{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年 多哈决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:01.09,TL,,0,0,0,,他以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}战胜菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.09,0:01:04.94,TL,,0,0,0,,又是{\fs78}5{\fs68}场胜利 又是一座{\fs78}500{\fs68}赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.95,0:01:10.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Devastating from start to finish, under the lights here tonight.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今晚 从头到尾都势不可挡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:13.16,TL,,0,0,0,,这里要说清一个区别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:16.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月的巴塞罗那 他首轮获胜后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.01,0:01:18.89,TL,,0,0,0,,因为右手腕伤势 退出第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.89,0:01:20.89,TL,,0,0,0,,那一胜仍然计入战绩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.89,0:01:23.47,TL,,0,0,0,,赛前退赛不算一场已赛失利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:25.75,TL,,0,0,0,,所以 全胜指打过的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:28.54,TL,,0,0,0,,不代表每次参赛都拿冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:30.80,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月回到东京
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.79,TL,,0,0,0,,他再次五战夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:34.96,TL,,0,0,0,,多哈五胜 巴塞罗那一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:37.77,TL,,0,0,0,,东京五胜 再加这周维也纳五胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.77,0:01:41.22,TL,,0,0,0,,才是今年{\fs78}16{\fs68}胜{\fs78}0{\fs68}负的完整口径
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:47.68,TL,,0,0,0,,可维也纳这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:50.30,TL,,0,0,0,,比全胜两个字惊险得多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:52.55,TL,,0,0,0,,前{\fs78}4{\fs68}场 每一场的第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:54.60,TL,,0,0,0,,都要靠抢七结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.53,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮对哈恰诺夫 第二盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:02:00.51,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡错过{\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点 反被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:03.99,TL,,0,0,0,,他随后回破 才把比赛带进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:16.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a match that lived up to the billing{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场比赛不负期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:19.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}when the tournament draw was announced.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N正如签表公布时大家所盼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:21.44,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮对巴西拉什维利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:24.84,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 第二盘却要救{\fs78}4{\fs68}个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:26.54,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.28,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分轮到他发球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:31.16,TL,,0,0,0,,盘分还领先 危险已经来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:32.59,TL,,0,0,0,,他要先救回盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:34.78,TL,,0,0,0,,再争取结束比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:43.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can you believe the audacity?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你敢相信他这么大胆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:47.00,TL,,0,0,0,,从七平 一路打到{\fs78}13{\fs68}比{\fs78}11{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:50.09,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡直到第四个赛点才拿下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:52.72,TL,,0,0,0,,全场没有丢盘 和全场没有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.62,TL,,0,0,0,,完全是两回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:03.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, he's missed it this time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一回 他没能打进！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:08.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That was a tough examination, that tie-break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场抢七 是艰难的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.04,0:03:11.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Credit to Nikoloz Basilashvili.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巴西拉什维利值得称赞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:13.83,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来是保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:15.61,TL,,0,0,0,,对手拿到{\fs78}5{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:17.36,TL,,0,0,0,,一个都没能兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:20.27,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}过关
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.27,0:03:21.72,TL,,0,0,0,,守住的{\fs78}5{\fs68}次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:24.54,TL,,0,0,0,,也让他把连胜带进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.80,0:03:27.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:39.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another test for Carlos Alcaraz, which he passes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一道考验 阿尔卡拉斯过关
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:43.20,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 梅德韦杰夫带着七连胜而来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.66,TL,,0,0,0,,今年印第安维尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.15,TL,,0,0,0,,他曾终结阿卡的赛季不败
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:49.94,TL,,0,0,0,,室内再相遇 阿卡{\fs78}4{\fs68}次争取破发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:52.37,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}次成功 又在第二盘抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:54.63,TL,,0,0,0,,以{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}收下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:08.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The test passed for Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯经受住了考验
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:10.47,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 德米纳尔带着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:13.12,TL,,0,0,0,,今年室内{\fs78}10{\fs68}战全胜的战绩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.60,TL,,0,0,0,,他开局就被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.88,TL,,0,0,0,,却没有轻易交出比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:19.24,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}7{\fs68}局 {\fs78}5{\fs68}局打到平分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:21.48,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡在这些拉锯中{\fs78}3{\fs68}次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:23.19,TL,,0,0,0,,才拿下{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:26.29,TL,,0,0,0,,这个比分 藏住了不少对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:27.78,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:30.36,TL,,0,0,0,,德米纳尔在第二 第四 第八局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:32.02,TL,,0,0,0,,都救过破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:34.53,TL,,0,0,0,,第八局 比分回到平分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:37.43,TL,,0,0,0,,他还在争取把局分追成四平
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.43,0:04:39.06,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡想要拿走冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:41.88,TL,,0,0,0,,必须再赢下一次这样的拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, magnificent again from De Minaur!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德米纳尔又一次精彩化解！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How's the defence there?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这样的防守 太出色了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:14.20,TL,,0,0,0,,德米纳尔随后守住了这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:16.65,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡随后保发 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:17.91,TL,,0,0,0,,再次接发时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.91,0:05:21.15,TL,,0,0,0,,对手从{\fs78}30{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先 连丢三分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:23.55,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡第一次拿到冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:26.84,TL,,0,0,0,,小球 挑高球 再回到底线 这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:29.83,TL,,0,0,0,,奖杯要靠最后一次对抗挣出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:02.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a way to win the title!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这样拿下冠军 太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:06.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡洛斯 阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:09.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Vienna champion for the first time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一次成为维也纳冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:13.61,TL,,0,0,0,,从去年的女王杯 到今天维也纳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:16.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}次捧杯 {\fs78}26{\fs68}连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:17.62,TL,,0,0,0,,今年{\fs78}16{\fs68}胜{\fs78}0{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.96,TL,,0,0,0,,第{\fs78}11{\fs68}座{\fs78}500{\fs68}赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.96,0:06:21.58,TL,,0,0,0,,你更佩服他的进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:24.93,TL,,0,0,0,,还是关键时刻守住自己的能力？
